}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、抢劫事件：", "block_bbox": [144, 857, 301, 888], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[144.0, 857.0], [301.0, 857.0], [301.0, 888.0], [144.0, 888.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [134, 907, 214, 933], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 907.0], [213.0, 907.0], [213.0, 932.0], [134.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、2007年，一员工下班途中因与来接的家人没有相遇而遭到犯罪分子劫持，最终被残忍的杀害；", "block_bbox": [133, 931, 538, 999], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[133.0, 931.0], [538.0, 931.0], [538.0, 999.0], [133.0, 999.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、2012年，一员工下班途中因住的较偏僻遭犯罪分子拦路抢劫，幸亏刚好有路人经过，犯罪分子逃跑；", "block_bbox": [134, 998, 538, 1064], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 998.0], [538.0, 998.0], [538.0, 1064.0], [134.0, 1064.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、2014年，一员工在ATM机取钱时被犯罪分子盯上，后被抢走现金500元；", "block_bbox": [134, 1064, 538, 1108], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 1064.0], [538.0, 1064.0], [538.0, 1108.0], [134.0, 1108.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、2015年，一员工在和别人合租的房子处遭到犯罪分子的抢劫，员工反应及时转身就跑，随后报警，后警方将犯罪分子抓获。", "block_bbox": [133, 1107, 535, 1180], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[133.0, 1107.0], [535.0, 1107.0], [535.0, 1180.0], [133.0, 1180.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [735, 824, 1044, 1042], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[735.0, 824.0], [1044.0, 824.0], [1044.0, 1042.0], [735.0, 1042.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [734, 1047, 1043, 1237], "block_id": 22, "block_order": null, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[734.0, 1047.0], [1043.0, 10